Atlassian CLI (acli)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Component:  Atlassian CLI
Version:    Set by ACLI_VERSION at build time
License:    Atlassian proprietary terms
Upstream:   https://developer.atlassian.com/cloud/acli/

How it reaches a build
    scripts/fetch_acli.py downloads the binary and verifies its checksum
    while docker/Dockerfile builds the worker image. The platform runs it as a
    separate process for Jira Cloud writes.

Obligation
    The Apache License does not cover acli. An operator who builds the worker
    image accepts Atlassian's terms for the binary.

